		<description><![CDATA[Hey everyone!  TemptOne painted his name onto a computer screen using the movements of his eyes only.  The Graffiti Research Lab crew projected the pieces onto the wall of a nearby building.  It was beautiful to see Tempt paint again even though it wasn&#039;t with a can.  Thanks to the Ebeling Group and GRL for coming to Los Angeles to make this possible for Tempt and family.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Hey everyone!  TemptOne painted his name onto a computer screen using the movements of his eyes only.  The Graffiti Research Lab crew projected the pieces onto the wall of a nearby building.  It was beautiful to see Tempt paint again even though it wasn&#8217;t with a can.  Thanks to the Ebeling Group and GRL for coming to Los Angeles to make this possible for Tempt and family.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
